            "line": 82,
            "text": "theorem pullback_partialY {F : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ}\n    (hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F (AxisEvaluation.strip window 20))\n    (Λ : ℝ) {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hp : p ∈ domain Λ) :\n    partialY (pullback Λ F) p = Λ * partialY F (rescalePoint Λ p)"
